eval/labels/*.probes.json

# 调研、设计与测量记录：开发过程留档，不作为发布物
docs/

# 指标报表与基线：含逐项数字与真实会话片段
eval/labels/report*.md
eval/labels/recall-report.md
eval/labels/*.scores.json
eval/labels/baseline*.json
